,null,null,null,null,null,9.7,9.4,28.3,27.5,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"Google DeepMind于2026年11月13日发布Gemini 4 Hydrogen模型，取代原有3.8 Flash版本，宣称速度提升2.5倍（较3.8 Flash），Terminal-Bench 4.1得分从18.2%跃升至57%，并通过Orchestrator动态切换模型降低24%配额消耗【k58hgl2fg6w3tw7df5ecwzd3q】。该模型新增自然语言查询、跨语言响应及工具调用功能，部署覆盖AI Studio、Gemini API、App及付费订阅服务【s16bhdwh4lh2pbp5ylcgfnul7】。部分报道称其代码生成能力得分翻倍，并开放即用权限，与Argon模型形成竞争【lc1x2nnj60qfhsnwyz73egbxk】。","latest":"Google发布Gemini 4 Hydrogen模型，提升复杂问题理解能力","cover":null},{"rank":2,"story":{"publicId":"beeeb509-597b-41cc-92a4-58f193090af3","title":"DeepMind发布AlphaGenome 2模型：基因预测精度提升30%-43%并新增甲基化分析功能"},"heat":9.9,"trend":"down","trendPct":-16.1,"badges":[],"participantCount":3,"sourceCount":3,"sourceNames":["The Decoder","Google DeepMind","The Verge · AI"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/4237b71601b7cec2b06ef2319001b3daa6952abcc9bca3ab8eef52724d47317d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a7c3302c0985fb1018d6e4d102c9e3a96e020635d636cac8ae02864664d03b7.webp 96w","name":"Google DeepMind","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","name":"The Decoder","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","name":"The Verge · AI","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,19.8,null,18.7,null,17.6,17.1,16.6,16.2,15.7,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"DeepMind发布AlphaGenome 2模型，将特定细胞类型基因表达预测精度提升30%-43%（方向性基因效应识别率从34%升至43%，因果变体识别率首次披露为16%），新增DNA甲基化预测模块并开放API访问权限。该模型基于1.07亿个体细胞数据训练，支持通过少量细胞数据推断新细胞状态，已在COVID-19疫苗研究中验证区分激活T细胞的能力。不同报道对精度提升的具体指标存在差异：Google官方称方向性基因效应识别率提升至43%（未披露前代数值），The Verge称精度提升30%-43%；The Decoder则强调疾病基因和疫苗响应预测精度提升30%，并指出致病基因变体识别准确率优于前代16%。","latest":"Google Deepmind推出AlphaGenome 2单细胞基因组分析模型","cover":null},{"rank":3,"story":{"publicId":"37e89929-a9f0-478b-8790-2de7331487a0","title":"美国联合航空全面禁止AI代理预订机票，称需防范网络安全风险及合规问题"},"heat":8.7,"trend":"down","trendPct":-15.5,"badges":[],"participantCount":2,"sourceCount":2,"sourceNames":["TechCrunch · AI","The Verge · AI"],"participants":[{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/3a89defb5d85af0eb3b8ae44cc4a4d5bbe7150da8ad56480e7df423a25f1634d.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/f83b9939b71849f03e1cfe17720252190fc3d192a62e2df01d35ba93d3a74abe.webp 96w","name":"TechCrunch · AI","kind":"editorial"},{"iconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp","iconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/d8005acd58268e7cd7fda60d43e180921e5eb3ac716974f75571ef865eaf42e1.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/508d02b218ca7bfa61c74670d05f53a07ecedde92eae0e22745808551ce59bf1.webp 96w","name":"The Verge · AI","kind":"editorial"}],"spark":[null,6.3,null,5.9,null,5.6,5.4,14.5,14.1,13.7,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],"summary":"美国联合航空自2026年11月12日起禁止个人AI助手直接预订航班，称需遵守联邦隐私规定并防范网络安全风险【新】。CEO Scott Kirby指出当前AI技术无法验证用户操作意图与安全性，但表示未来可能重新评估政策【新】。该禁令效仿eBay和多家银行限制未经授权AI工具访问账户的做法，但联合航空是首个将此类政策扩展至航空预订领域的大型航空公司【新】。根据11月13日TechCrunch报道，联合航空通过直接限制平台访问权限和间接管控第三方渠道双重措施实施禁令，并特别提到与银行类似，客户若将账户密码共享给AI助手可能导致资金损失或行程变更【新】。","latest":"美国联合航空禁止AI代理预订机票，称存在网络安全风险","cover":null},{"rank":4,"story":{"pub